.* WRKF: the files a name and an attribute select, with their options.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=FILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ATTR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=FILES VARS='OPT FILE LIB ATTR TEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display names only
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Repeat position to
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Position to
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKF KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKFH ENTER='RETURN 1'.Work with Files
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=FILES ACTLEN=2 EXTACT=YES VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='CMD ?CRTPF FILE(&LIB./&FILE.)'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?CPYF FROMFILE(&LIB./&FILE.)'.3=Copy
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DLTF FILE(&LIB./&FILE.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DSPPFM FILE(&LIB./&FILE.)'.5=Display physical file member
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DSPFD FILE(&LIB./&FILE.)'.8=Display file description
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?SAVOBJ OBJ(&FILE.) LIB(&LIB.) OBJTYPE(*FILE)'.9=Save
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?RSTOBJ OBJ(&FILE.) SAVLIB(&LIB.) OBJTYPE(*FILE)'.10=Restore
:LISTACT OPTION=13 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?CHGOBJD OBJ(&LIB./&FILE.) OBJTYPE(*FILE)'.13=Change description
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES.File
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=ATTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Attribute
:LISTCOL VAR=TEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT FILE LIB ATTR TEXT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT FILE LIB'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 3, 4, 5, 8, 9, 10 and 13 or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKFH.Work with Files - Help
:P.The files the name and attribute select, a row each. Type an option
next to a file, or on the first line with a new name to create one, and
press Enter; a command typed on the command line runs as typed.
:P.F17 positions the list at the file named on the command line, F16
does it again, F11 shows the names alone and F5 lists the files again.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave the list. F4 prompts the command on the command
line, F9 brings the previous one back.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
